Third-party components
======================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in this repository only.

DJI UnityBridge
---------------
Driving the RoboMaster S1 requires DJI's proprietary UnityBridge library, which
is NOT distributed in this repository and is not covered by our licence.
`scripts/install-bridge.sh` copies it from the github.com/brunoga/robomaster Go
module cache onto your own machine. Its terms are DJI's.

brunoga/robomaster
------------------
The Go library that speaks the S1's app-mode protocol, and the reason this
project is possible at all: https://github.com/brunoga/robomaster

Models and weights
------------------
Ultralytics YOLO weights and any Ollama models are downloaded at run time under
their own licences. None are included here.

Recorded data
-------------
Frames, drive logs and corpora produced by this software stay on your machine;
`corpus/`, `logs/` and `runs/` are gitignored.
